  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet humor, dark humor, and taboo-based jokes. It targets viewers who appreciate shock value, crude sexual innuendo, and body-based humor, often found in meme culture. The audience is likely to be adults who understand the metaphorical and provocative nature of the text, and who find humor in socially inappropriate or taboo subjects. The visual of a young man in formal attire with a smug expression is a common trope in internet memes, suggesting the target audience is familiar with this aesthetic and its use in conveying irony or absurdity.",
